          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تعليم (taʿlīm) is built on the native Arabic root ʿ-l-m, \"to know\" (Lane). Taʿlīm is the Form II verbal noun, making someone know: teaching, education."
            }
          ]
        },
